  "body": "What is missing: no assertion in the structural twin covers the \"Repeat each depth\" checkbox that PR #518 adds to the thread Passes tab.\n\nEvidence: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/structural.rs` has no AccessKit label or enabled-state check for this checkbox. AGENTS.md says that a UI change updates the structural assertions.\n\nFound in the review of PR #518.\n\nDone means: `structural.rs` asserts the label, the role and the enabled state of the checkbox. The test passes in the default suite.\n",
